{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذْ", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "نَجَّيْنَـٰكُم", "translation": "We saved you"}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ءَالِ", "translation": "(the) people"}, {"text": "فِرْعَوْنَ", "translation": "(of) Firaun"}, {"text": "يَسُومُونَكُمْ", "translation": "(who were) afflicting you (with)"}, {"text": "سُوٓءَ", "translation": "horrible"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَذَابِ", "translation": "torment"}, {"text": "يُذَبِّحُونَ", "translation": "slaughtering"}, {"text": "أَبْنَآءَكُمْ", "translation": "your sons"}, {"text": "وَيَسْتَحْيُونَ", "translation": "and letting live"}, {"text": "نِسَآءَكُمْ ۚ", "translation": "your women"}, {"text": "وَفِى", "translation": "And in"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكُم", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "بَلَآءٌۭ", "translation": "(was) a trial"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "رَّبِّكُمْ", "translation": "your Lord"}, {"text": "عَظِيمٌۭ", "translation": "great"}], "sahih": "And [recall] when We saved you [i.e., your forefathers] from the people of Pharaoh, who afflicted you with the worst torment, slaughtering your [newborn] sons and keeping your females alive. And in that was a great trial from your Lord."}